---
export const title = 'Usage';
export const order = 100;
import DemoComponentCard from '../../../../components/DemoComponentCard.astro';
---

<p>
  A standard <code>wc-navigation-drawer</code> sits next to the page content and shows while
  <code>open</code> is set. Each <code>wc-navigation-drawer-item</code> takes an icon, a label and an
  optional <code>badge</code>. Mark the page the user is on with <code>current</code>: the item
  gets the active indicator and <code>aria-current="page"</code>. Clicking an item makes it current
  and fires <code>change</code> with <code>{'{ value, index, item }'}</code>, the same detail as
  <code>wc-navigation-bar</code> and <code>wc-navigation-rail</code>.
</p>

<DemoComponentCard lang={'html'}>
  <div style='height: 360px; border: 1px solid var(--color-outline-variant); border-radius: 1rem; overflow: hidden;'>
    <wc-navigation-drawer open headline='Mail' style='--navigation-drawer-width: 280px;'>
      <wc-navigation-drawer-item value='inbox' current badge='24'>
        <wc-icon slot='icon' name='inbox'></wc-icon>
        Inbox
      </wc-navigation-drawer-item>
      <wc-navigation-drawer-item value='sent'>
        <wc-icon slot='icon' name='send'></wc-icon>
        Sent
      </wc-navigation-drawer-item>
      <wc-navigation-drawer-item value='drafts' badge='3'>
        <wc-icon slot='icon' name='draft'></wc-icon>
        Drafts
      </wc-navigation-drawer-item>
      <wc-navigation-drawer-item value='trash' disabled disabled-reason='Trash is turned off'>
        <wc-icon slot='icon' name='delete'></wc-icon>
        Trash
      </wc-navigation-drawer-item>
    </wc-navigation-drawer>
  </div>
</DemoComponentCard>

<h3>Deprecated</h3>
<ul>
  <li>
    <code>active</code> on <code>wc-navigation-drawer-item</code>: use <code>current</code>. It
    still works and logs a warning; it is removed in 4.0.
  </li>
  <li>
    <code>wc-sidebar-menu</code>, <code>wc-sidebar-sub-menu</code> and
    <code>wc-sidebar-menu-item</code>: use a drawer with groups (below).
  </li>
</ul>
